                                            "name":  "Fractured Blast",
                                            "description":  "Slash and stagger enemies with a crystal blast that inflicts \u003cDT_SLASH_COLOR\u003eSlash Status. Enemies afflicted with this Status Effect have an increased chance of dropping Health and Energy Orbs.",
